msgid "Select the City and Press Ok"
msgstr "Izberite mesto in pritisnite OK"

msgid "Select the detail level in the detail view. You have the choice between a comprehensive presentation in a smaller font and a reduced presentation with a larger font."
msgstr "Izberite raven podrobnosti v pogledu podrobnosti. Izbirate lahko med celovito predstavitvijo v manjši pisavi in ​​pomanjšano predstavitvijo z večjo pisavo."

msgid "Select the metric unit for wind speed to be used for wind displays. This has no effect on the imperial unit 'mph'."
msgstr "Izberite metrično enoto za hitrost vetra, ki bo uporabljena za prikaz vetra. To ne vpliva na imperialno enoto 'mph'."

msgid "Select the preferred weather service to supply the weather information."
msgstr "Izberite želeno vremensko storitev za posredovanje vremenskih informacij."

msgid "Select the temperature unit to be used for temperature displays."
msgstr "Izberite temperaturno enoto, ki bo uporabljena za prikaze temperature."

msgid "Select this option to save that last obtained weather data locally. This is used to initialize the data immediately after restart while updated data is being fetched."
msgstr "Izberite to možnost, če želite lokalno shraniti zadnje pridobljene vremenske podatke. To se uporablja za inicializacijo podatkov takoj po ponovnem zagonu, medtem ko se posodobljeni podatki pridobivajo."

